---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="think-story" aria-label="How the THINK bottleneck changes with AI and Poesis">
  <div class="think-story__phases">
    <article class="think-phase" aria-labelledby="think-history-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">01 · Historically — The THINK pathology</span>
        <h3 id="think-history-title">THINK lived in people&rsquo;s heads and prose — BUILD and RUN moved at its speed or drifted.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-phase__flow">
        <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--narrow">
          <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="compass" size={16} /><strong>THINK</strong></span>
          <span class="think-capacity__definition">Define, evaluate, govern</span>
          <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--bad">implicitly, manually, in people&rsquo;s heads</span>
        </div>
        <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="think-capacity-group">
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="layers" size={16} /><strong>BUILD</strong></span>
            <span class="think-capacity__definition">Generate from definitions</span>
            <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--bad">held in people&rsquo;s heads &mdash; all human</span>
          </div>
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="play" size={16} /><strong>RUN</strong></span>
            <span class="think-capacity__definition">Operate</span>
            <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--bad">by hand, against nothing explicit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="think-phase__foot">
        <span class="think-phase__details-label">Pain points</span>
        <ul class="think-phase__details">
          <li>Purpose, rules, and constraints scattered across people, meetings, documents, and tools.</li>
          <li>Every handoff reconstructed THINK — and lost a little of it each time.</li>
          <li>THINK artifacts went stale as BUILD and RUN changed — definition and reality drifted apart.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="think-phase think-phase--warning" aria-labelledby="think-ai-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">02 · Today — Gen AI on pathological THINK</span>
        <h3 id="think-ai-title">AI generates probabilistically against implicit definitions — lose speed, or lose alignment.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-phase__flow">
        <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--narrow">
          <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="compass" size={16} /><strong>THINK</strong></span>
          <span class="think-capacity__definition">Define, evaluate, govern</span>
          <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--bad">implicitly, manually, in people&rsquo;s heads</span>
        </div>
        <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="think-capacity-group think-capacity-group--expanded">
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="layers" size={16} /><strong>BUILD</strong></span>
            <span class="think-capacity__definition">Generate from definitions</span>
            <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--bad">that stay implicit &mdash; now AI-accelerated</span>
          </div>
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="play" size={16} /><strong>RUN</strong></span>
            <span class="think-capacity__definition">Operate</span>
            <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--bad">AI-accelerated, still against nothing explicit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="think-phase__foot">
        <span class="think-phase__details-label">Pain points</span>
        <ul class="think-phase__details">
          <li>Keep the speed: every artifact drifts further from intent, compounding at machine pace.</li>
          <li>Restore alignment at every handoff: prompts, reviews, corrections, and controls consume the acceleration gain.</li>
          <li>Human attention becomes the control plane — understanding, validation, coordination, and accountability remain scarce.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="think-phase think-phase--poesis" aria-labelledby="think-poesis-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">03 · Decided now — The Poesis Gene Therapy</span>
        <h3 id="think-poesis-title">Human + AI capacity goes to THINK first — governance decides what becomes authoritative.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-therapy">
        <div class="think-therapy__aside">
          <div class="think-phase__flow">
            <a class="think-capacity think-capacity--governed think-capacity--link" href="#use-case-think">
              <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="compass" size={16} /><strong>THINK</strong></span>
              <span class="think-capacity__definition">Define, evaluate, govern</span>
              <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--good">explicitly, AI-accelerated, shared</span>
            </a>
            <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            <div class="think-capacity-group think-capacity-group--expanded">
              <a class="think-capacity think-capacity--link" href="#use-case-build">
                <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="layers" size={16} /><strong>BUILD</strong></span>
                <span class="think-capacity__definition">Generate from definitions</span>
                <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--good">that are explicit and governed &mdash; by AI or programmatically</span>
              </a>
              <a class="think-capacity think-capacity--link" href="#use-case-run">
                <span class="think-capacity__head"><Icon name="play" size={16} /><strong>RUN</strong></span>
                <span class="think-capacity__definition">Operate</span>
                <span class="think-capacity__state think-capacity__state--good">against the definition &mdash; by AI or programmatically</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="think-therapy__body">
          <span class="think-phase__details-label">Capabilities</span>
          <ul class="think-therapy__grid">
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="grid" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Governed organizational context</span></span>
              <strong>Context engineered, not retrieved</strong>
              <p>Subjects, relations and obligations become typed, shared and machine-operable — the organizational context agents, people and tools consume, instead of prompts and retrieval over documents.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="layers" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Composed governance fabric</span></span>
              <strong>Frameworks and regulations, composed</strong>
              <p>TOGAF, the ISO 25000 series, GDPR, NIS2 and more attach from a catalogue and compose into one enforceable obligation set.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="handshake" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Governance lifecycle</span></span>
              <strong>AI proposes, humans put into effect</strong>
              <p>Definitions are sourced and structured upstream, then promoted through an explicit lifecycle — every authoritative change stays attributed and traceable.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="repos" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Automatic truth sourcing</span></span>
              <strong>Definitions author themselves</strong>
              <p>AI and deterministic analysis source definitions from code, contracts, infrastructure and evidence — with confidence and provenance — so the model tracks what actually runs.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="search" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Continuous norm evaluation</span></span>
              <strong>Definition checked against reality</strong>
              <p>Norms are evaluated into deterministic verdicts against observed reality, so divergence surfaces the moment it appears.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="play" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Generative delivery</span></span>
              <strong>Definitions that generate systems</strong>
              <p>Governed definitions become running systems and derived deliverables — through harnessed agentic workflows with deterministic checks and human gates.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="think-phase__foot think-therapy__values">
        <span class="think-phase__details-label">Values</span>
        <p class="think-therapy__values-lead"><strong>The organization becomes intelligible</strong> &mdash; to the people and the machines who think, build, and run it. Definitions stop being prose: a structured causal context that can be reasoned over, taught, governed, simulated, and continuously evaluated.</p>
        <ul class="think-consequence-list">
          <li>
            <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="compass" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Analysis power</span></span>
            <strong>Impact is traced before the decision</strong>
            <p>Changes ripple through typed relations, so blast radius, dependencies, and affected obligations are reasoned from the model instead of guessed in a meeting.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="check-badge" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Continuous evaluation</span></span>
            <strong>The conformance state is known continuously</strong>
            <p>Every divergence between the definition and observed reality surfaces the moment it appears &mdash; not at audit time, and not after it has propagated.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="list" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Governed authority</span></span>
            <strong>Nothing enters into effect ungoverned</strong>
            <p>Definitions and operations &mdash; proposed by AI or by people &mdash; take effect only through the explicit lifecycle, so authority stays human, attributed, and never implicit.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="shield" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Accountable autonomy</span></span>
            <strong>Execution can be delegated without losing control</strong>
            <p>Agentic and automated action stays bounded by Directives and Norms, so autonomy can grow without accountability being traded away for speed.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="spark" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Resource economy</span></span>
            <strong>The same resources deliver more</strong>
            <p>Intent stops being rebuilt at every handoff and deliverables derive from the model, releasing the human and compute capacity that drift consumes.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="think-consequence__head"><span class="think-consequence__icon"><Icon name="book-open" size={16} /></span><span class="think-consequence__step">Audit readiness</span></span>
            <strong>The history of the model is the audit trail</strong>
            <p>Every governed change is a retained, versioned transition carrying its provenance &mdash; evidence exists by construction, not reconstructed under audit pressure.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>